      truth exists but the MCP entry is not yet wired (whether because
      `.mcp.json` is missing the key, because `.mcp.json` cannot be
      read, or because `mcpServerConfig.args` is null-armed); `mcp-drift`
      covers content disagreement between two non-null configs; `ok`
      covers full agreement on fully-wired configs."
    - >-
